# ── Function, equip & closure lowering (split out of lower.gg) ───────
# `lower_function`, trait/equip-block lowering, return-type guessing, and
# the whole closure-capture analysis cluster (capture detection, nested-
# closure scan, closure-sig computation, `lower_closure_body`). Moved
# verbatim from lower.gg as part of the lower.gg module split (output-
# neutral pure function move). The STRING_MARKER sentinel (a private
# global used only by guess_return_type/compute_closure_sig) moves with
# the cluster.
